steam","shortDescription":"Lead your people. Survive the wilderness. Fight for honor. Reclaim your eternal reward. A brand new strategy game from the developers of Cultures and The Settlers II.","detailedDescription":"Buzz\n\nAbout the Game\n\nYou spent your whole life in service to the gods of Asgard. You died an honorable death. You earned your place in the halls of Valhalla. \nBut when you knocked on its gates to receive your final reward, none answered. Odin has turned his back on your people. He underestimates the Viking spirit. He underestimates you.\n\nForce their hand as you lead your people past the dangers waiting on Valhalla Hills and fight to prove your honor, your strength, your worthiness. Look after your Vikings, gathering food, chopping wood, and mastering the complex economics of wilderness survival. \nReach the portal at the top of each mountain, and shout your battle cry loud enough for the gods to hear.\n\n If they will not give your people the reward you all deserve, then by your axe, you will take it from them.\n \n\n \n• Be prepared for randomly generated levels with various challenges\n\n• Look after your Vikings' needs\n\n• Improve constantly, use your knowledge and achievements for the next map\n\n• Earn your place in Valhalla, for your Vikings and yourself","aboutGame":"You spent your whole life in service to the gods of Asgard. You died an honorable death. You earned your place in the halls of Valhalla. \nBut when you knocked on its gates to receive your final reward, none answered. Odin has turned his back on your people. He underestimates the Viking spirit. He underestimates you.\n\nForce their hand as you lead your people past the dangers waiting on Valhalla Hills and fight to prove your honor, your strength, your worthiness. Look after your Vikings, gathering food, chopping wood, and mastering the complex economics of wilderness survival. \nReach the portal at the top of each mountain, and shout your battle cry loud enough for the gods to hear.\n\n If they will not give your people the reward you all deserve, then by your axe, you will take it from them.\n \n\n \n• Be prepared for randomly generated levels with various challenges\n\n• Look after your Vikings' needs\n\n• Improve constantly, use your knowledge and achievements for the next map\n\n• Earn your place in Valhalla, for your Vikings and yourself"},"vi":{"status":"pending_translation","provider":null,"shortDescription":null,"detailedDescription":null,"aboutGame":null}},"media":{"images":[{"role":"header","url":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/351910/header.jpg?t=1789475400"},{"role":"capsule","url":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/351910/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1789475400"},{"role":"description","url":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/351910/extras/57e8f4f09502b70a3c4ca3662122c94e.avif?t=1789475400","alt":""},{"role":"description","url":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/351910/extras/7787f3660ede0c25088a82745e1e7c43.avif?t=1789475400","alt":""}],"screenshots":[{"id":0,"thumbnailUrl":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/351910/ss_22e66122863b278d7a066b0997103dc17d481587.600x338.jpg?t=1789475400","url":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/351910/ss_22e66122863b278d7a066b0997103dc17d481587.1920x1080.jpg?t=1789475400"},{"id":1,"thumbnailUrl":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/351910/ss_3f5dcb44672ea077ec77c4d6d3d84d46bc54c1b7.600x338.jpg?t=1789475400","url":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/351910/ss_3f5dcb44672ea077ec77c4d6d3d84d46bc54c1b7.1920x1080.jpg?t=1789475400"},{"id":2,"thumbnailUrl":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/351910/ss_cd1defd96113383ed10133aa116a1d2053853e29.600x338.jpg?t=1789475400","url":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/stor